Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:58.02,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.02,0:01:00.29,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.29,0:01:02.79,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.04,0:03:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Spike! {ends on the frame before the white impact frame}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.53,0:03:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.08,0:03:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just about done myself.\NWhat's cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.51,0:03:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Special "beef with bell peppers."\N(Qing-jiao-rou-si) {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Asimov Solensan. This is our next target.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jet...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a high-end of the syndicate\Nthat deals all around the asteroids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,About this Qing-jiao-rou-si...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.91,0:03:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy's name is Asimov Solensan.\NWeren't you listening to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't call a meatless\N"beef with bell peppers" {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.13,0:03:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"beef with bell peppers"... do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.14,0:03:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you don't! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.41,0:03:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You do when you're broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the 1 million woolongs\Nwe got as bounty from that last guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.47,0:04:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The repair bill for\Nthe plane you wrecked...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.19,0:04:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and the repair bill\Nfor the shop you trashed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.77,0:04:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and the medical bill\Nof the cop you injured...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,killed all the dough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.15,0:04:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days ago, there was a shootout\Nbetween his group and an enemy syndicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed his own men and took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he's hiding\Nwith his woman in Tijuana.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a place for nobodies to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite being a nobody,\Nhe's worth 2.5 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.99,0:04:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't feel like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.70,0:04:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tijuana... The beef there
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,is {\i1}really{\i0} tasty...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.87,0:04:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Attention, please.\NWe will soon arrive at the gate.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.30,0:04:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We look forward to serving you again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please line up single file at\Nthe tollbooth after clearing the gate.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please pass by after switching\Nthe credit sensors to debit mode.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.64,0:05:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll head over after\Nhitting the cops for clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.01,0:05:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then I'll try seeing old man Bull.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can you trust that old guy?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.09,0:05:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Such an easygoing song.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.74,0:06:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This again? Goddamn son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.86,0:06:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, you're totally ripping me off,\Nbut do ya realize
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.98,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the reason you can live here is because
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I dug that gate with all my might, ya hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This again. You always\Nsay that when you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We all dug the gate together, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.95,0:06:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That we did. We dug like\Nthere was no tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn idiot son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.49,0:07:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll have a Bloody Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I got vodka, but unfortunately\NI'm out of tomato juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.83,0:07:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's {\i1}one can{\i0}\Nin the back room...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.56,0:07:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.82,0:07:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Top-notch "Red-Eye."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.10,0:07:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd know, as a buyer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it be... "Bloody-Eye"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Prove to me that it's the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep those eyes open!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is dandy,\Nbut you got anything to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The red-eyed coyote will appear\Nat the north end of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.81,0:09:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A red-eyed coyote, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.97,0:09:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You, "Swimming Bird."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.64,0:09:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall meet a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.92,0:09:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall be targeted by that woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.89,0:10:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And then... death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Again. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"Again"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already died once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.73,0:10:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Got killed by a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.43,0:10:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You take women too lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.67,0:10:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch ya later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.69,0:10:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,May he be blessed by Wakan tanka.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Presidente?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.23,0:10:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have a glass on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.93,0:10:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn. Asimov sure lost his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.19,0:10:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No shit. We gotta do something\Nbefore the cops start moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya wanna leave it up to the cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.45,0:10:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He {\i1}is{\i0} using those eye drops.\NThere's no way we can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.93,0:10:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tellin' ya, we got nothin' if\Nwe don't get that "Bloody-Eye" back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:10:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.08,0:11:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you give me the specifics?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.90,0:11:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.75,0:12:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better to leave the water running.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.88,0:12:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Or it'll clog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.04,0:12:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops! {added this}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.85,0:12:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.30,0:12:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? {added this}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.15,0:12:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...I'f soffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.57,0:12:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ew! I don't want that anymore!\NYou can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Lukfy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.11,0:13:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, honest. {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.57,0:13:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Felt like my stomach was\Ngoing to be glued to my back. {4 extra frames lead-out}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.41,0:13:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.70,0:13:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an old model.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been with me for over ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.81,0:13:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've gotten\Na lot of use out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.50,0:13:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I travel around a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm actually a wandering performer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell if you're\Nfor real or just joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.52,0:13:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of people say that about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.86,0:13:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Been to Mars yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.41,0:13:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born on Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.34,0:13:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They have everything there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.78,0:13:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike here, Mars has lots\Nof people, lots of things...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.57,0:13:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They must live happily there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.40,0:13:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.51,0:13:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure we'll be happy there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You planning on escaping to Mars?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.27,0:14:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Running away...\Nbut how far can you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.75,0:14:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.35,0:14:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,An old-fashioned cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bounty hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to catch us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.27,0:14:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your buddy seems to be pretty ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.99,0:14:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't deal with weakened nobodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wise decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.48,0:14:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} are the nobody!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.61,0:14:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Asimov! That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.33,0:14:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Adios, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.48,0:14:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I coulda killed him in one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.67,0:15:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're tired. If you do this anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.42,0:15:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He was young and attractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.19,0:15:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I was waiting so long for\Nyou to come pick me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.17,0:15:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can finally escape the low life I've had here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.59,0:15:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can finally live happily on Mars...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.17,0:15:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A nap. How peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a good dream. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.18,0:15:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can see the rest of\Nthat dream on the Bebop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.01,0:15:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving up on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.00,0:15:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.10,0:15:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,When Asimov left his syndicate,\Nhe snuck something out with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.31,0:16:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The top-end stuff of all the illegal\Neye drops that the syndicate makes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.09,0:16:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He took off with all of the drops,\Nso the group is in a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They wanna catch him,\Nbut all they get back are corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.41,0:16:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Asimov is using it... {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.98,0:16:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The eye drops known as "Bloody-Eye."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They're planning on going to Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mars?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But before that, they'll sell this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.44,0:16:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I grabbed it from his breast pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.27,0:16:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You... met him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.55,0:16:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.37,0:16:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He got you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.72,0:16:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The red-eyed coyote will supposedly\Nappear at the north end of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This again? Goddamn son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, you're totally rippin' me off,\Nbut do ya realize the reason you can eat well
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.57,0:17:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,around here is because I cultivated\Nthe land with my buddies, ya hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and that's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.54,0:17:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That we did...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.23,0:17:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We planted seeds like\Nthere was no tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.02,0:17:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You were always planting "seeds"\Nof a different kind, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You have any Bloody Marys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.97,0:17:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I only got beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.11,0:17:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got tomato juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.01,0:17:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.09,0:17:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,300,000 woolongs. I got 50 packs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,15 million woolongs, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry. I'll find others\Nif you don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.83,0:17:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lookin' for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.81,0:17:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you know what {\i1}you{\i0} are worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:17:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Only 2.5 million woolongs. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.83,0:18:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a cheap guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.45,0:18:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when are you a buyer?\NDid you give up on bounty hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.47,0:18:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No thrill in cheap bounties.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.83,0:18:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you do better as a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.23,0:18:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure I will. I owe you one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.97,0:18:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You trust your eyes too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a chameleon!\NYou can't see everywhere all at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.89,0:19:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That way! That way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, stay still!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.46,0:19:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.16,0:19:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doomed if these break!\NBe more careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.06,0:19:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.51,0:19:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're late, Jet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.59,0:19:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.77,0:20:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Asimov.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.55,0:20:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Doing any more is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.13,0:20:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.02,0:21:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't run anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can get away...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Adios...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.55,0:21:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Spike, it's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.81,0:22:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.13,0:22:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What's cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.23,0:22:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Special "beef with bell peppers."
