Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.42,0:24:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, and so this program\Nis finally under way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.69,0:24:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.14,0:24:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Next week, we're completely changing\Ngears to show an anime for all ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.69,0:24:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it that kind of a story?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.77,0:24:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheerful animals wreak havoc all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.73,0:24:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.26,0:24:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But Dr. Doolittle won't be\Nmaking an appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.15,0:24:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,From little kids to the elderly,\Nif you love animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.15,0:24:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on now, Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.71,0:24:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone gather around\Nand watch the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.49,0:24:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it all right to say stuff like that?!\NI'm not responsible for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.70,0:24:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is one favor\Nto ask right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.50,0:24:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Good little kids should sit far\Nfrom the TV when watching the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.75,0:24:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.52,0:24:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back about a kilometer. {"A kilometer's good." "A kilometer should do."}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.64,0:24:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.87,0:24:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,800 meters then?
